  "text": "\r\n\t\t Voting & Elections | Wolfeboro, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n\t\t\t Search \n     Government   \t\t\t \n     Community   \t\t\t \n     Visitors   \t\t\t \n     How Do I...   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t DMV Appointment Scheduling \r\n\t\t\t Dog Licenses \r\n\t\t\t\t Dog License Form \r\n\t\t\t Forms \r\n\t\t\t\t AquaTherm Application (Thin Ice Signs) \r\n\t\t\t\t Birth Certificate Application \r\n\t\t\t\t Death Certificate Application \r\n\t\t\t\t Divorce Certificate Application \r\n\t\t\t\t Dredge & Fill Permits \r\n\t\t\t\t Marriage Certificate Application \r\n\t\t\t\t How to Use Computer / Device Fillable Forms \r\n\t\t\t\t How to Digitally Sign a Fillable Form \r\n\t\t\t\t Non-Resident Affidavit \r\n\t\t\t\t Residency Form \r\n\t\t\t\t Application For Vanity Plates \r\n\t\t\t Marriage Licenses \r\n\t\t\t Motor Vehicle Registration \r\n\t\t\t Online Payments \r\n\t\t\t Passports \r\n\t\t\t Town Ordinances \r\n\t\t\t Town Reports \r\n\t\t\t Vital Records \r\n\t\t\t Voting & Elections \r\nHome \nGovernment \nDepartments \nTown Clerk \nVoting & Elections \r\nVoting & Elections\t\t \r\nYou can register to vote at the Town Clerk's Office during regular office hours, or at the polling place on Election Day.  To register to vote, you need to fill out a Voter  Registration Form with your local clerk or supervisor of  the checklist and provide proof of your citizenship,  age, domicile (primary residence address) and identity.   Some examples include: \n•  US Citizenship  – birth certificate*, US passport,  naturalization papers   ( *if your name has legally changed since birth, please also provide proof of this change, i.e. marriage certificate, court documentation, etc.) \n•  Identity and Age  – driver’s license, government-issued photo ID, passport \n•  NH Residence  - driver’s license, government-issued  photo ID, vehicle registration, government-issued  tax document, government-issued check (all listing  domicile (primary residence address))  \nVoter Registration Requirements \r\nGreat Hall, 84 South Main Street \n/DocumentCenter/View/1618 \n2026 Primary Results Democrat \n2026 Primary Results Republican \nAbsentee Ballot for September 8 and November 3 elections \nNotice of Recount 2026 March 10 Election \n2026 TOWN ELECTION RESULTS \n2026 STATE SPECIAL ELECTION RESULTS \n2026 Declaration of Candidacy \n2026 Special Election Primary January 20 and Sample Ballots(PDF) \n2025 Town Warrant (PDF) \nMS 737 (PDF) \nDefault Budget (PDF) \nTown Election Results March 2024 (PDF) \nApplication for Town Absentee Ballot for 2026 (PDF) \nApplication for State Special Election Absentee Ballot 3-10-2026 \nState of New Hampshire Voter Information Look-up \nState Special General Election Posting 3-10-2026 \nMarch 2026 Sample Ballot for Special General Election \r\n\t\t\t Minutes & Agendas \nLearn more \r\n\t\t\t Town Calendar \nLearn more \r\n\t\t\t Online Payments \nLearn more \r\n\t\t\t Contact Us \nLearn more \r\n\t\t\t Forms & Documents \nLearn more \r\n\t\t\t Recreation \nLearn more \r\nContact Us \r\nTown of Wolfeboro \r\n84 S Main Street \r\nP.O. Box 629 \r\nWolfeboro, New Hampshire 03894 \r\nQuick Links \r\n         Public Notices \n         Hours \n         Property Tax Bills \n         Pay Utility Bills \n         Bids & RFPs \n         Employment Opportunities \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nSite Links \r\n         Contact Us \n         Website Sign-In \n         Site Map \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n         Disclaimer \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
